# Latest images
Each box with CI enabled can have the latest image on pipeline page
  - http://code/repo/pica8/pipelines

Latest build for each branch:
- http://code/repo/pica8/pipelines?scope=branches

If you want to download a build image for certain commit/merge/branch,
just look at the "Download" icon near the right side, and choose the
result image to download there.
- You can get the successful builds, even not all builds passed.

Tag triggered builds:
- http://code/repo/pica8/pipelines?scope=tags

To search build for certain boxes, find the "NAME" such as "s4048" here:
- http://code/repo/pica8/builds

Build status:
- http://code/repo/pica8/pipelines/charts

Manually create a build, in selected branch:
- http://code/repo/pica8/pipelines/new
- Be default, only the defined branch would be built with trigger from
  push/merge events

To check your custom CI syntax:
- http://code/ci/lint
- Otherwise, you would get "yaml invalid" in case of syntax issue.
  - http://code/repo/pica8/pipelines

# License
