## SDK related error
### No rule to make target libbcm_compat.a, needed by pica_lcmgr

```
make[4]: Entering directory 2.7.1/pica/lcmgr
make[4]: *** No rule to make target 2.7.1/pica/exlib/bcm_6.3.9.p5101/libbcm_compat.a, needed by `pica_lcmgr'. Stop.
