/usr/bin/ld: ../lib/libsdk/lb9alib/libdiag_flashLib.a(imageFile.o): Relocations in generic ELF (EM: 20)
/usr/bin/ld: ../lib/libsdk/lb9alib/libdiag_flashLib.a(imageFile.o): Relocations in generic ELF (EM: 20)
../lib/libsdk/lb9alib/libdiag_flashLib.a: could not read symbols: File in wrong format
collect2: ld returned 1 exit status
make[4]: *** [pica_sif] Error 1
```

- Cause
Cannot find a linker for that target.

- Solution
Add the toolchain to your PATH, or install the toolchain if necessary.

If it also can not work, then try "make clean" and "make distclean" and repeat compilation.

```
linux-kernel-bde.c:424: warning: implicit declaration of function 'va_end'
make[2]: *** [kernel_modules] Error 2
make[1]: *** [build] Error 2
make: *** [DIAG] Error 2
```

Perhaps this helps:
```
$ export CROSS_COMPILE_PATH=/tools/eldk4.2/usr
$ export PATH=$PATH:$CROSS_COMPILE_PATH/bin
```

## Ramdisk

```
cp -rfa rootfs/* ram_disk/
cp: writing `ram_disk/pica/bin/snmp/pica_snmp': No space left on device
cp: writing `ram_disk/pica/bin/stat/pica_stat': No space left on device
cp: writing `ram_disk/pica/bin/pica_default.boot': No space left on device
