cp: cannot create directory `ram_disk/pica/config': No space left on device
cp: cannot create directory `ram_disk/proc': No space left on device
cp: cannot create directory `ram_disk/sbin': No space left on device
cp: cannot create directory `ram_disk/tmp': No space left on device
cp: cannot create directory `ram_disk/usr': No space left on device
cp: cannot create directory `ram_disk/var': No space left on device
```

You can expand the ramdisk size to a larger one:

pica8/lb9a/Makefile:48:	dd if=/dev/zero of=initrd2m bs=1k count=120000

Currently, size below 130000 is a safe number.

