- [x] Dark/Light Theme
- [x] Custom 404 Page
- [x] Tags Page
- [x] Code Highlighter
- [x] Social Share
- [x] Atom & Json feeds
- [x] Robots.txt
- [x] Sitemap
- [x] Next & Previous Post
